  "card": "Fixes a memory leak in Windows subprocess execution where Popen::execute_process() allocated a command line buffer using new[] without deleting it. The fix passes std::string::data() directly to CreateProcessA, removing the temporary allocation entirely. The leak affects Windows nodes configured with an external signer (-signer=<cmd>) on each signer invocation, though impact is limited by the invocation rate and small command size.",
